15880acbeee6a53352f7.001.1"},{"event":"Flood Warning","headline":"Flood Warning issued October 24 at 8:04PM MDT until October 26 at 12:00PM MDT by NWS Pueblo CO","description":"...The Flood Warning is extended for the following rivers in\nColorado...\n\nRio Grande Near Del Norte affecting Rio Grande County.\n\nFor the Upper Rio Grande River...including Del Norte, Alamosa...Minor\nflooding is forecast.\n\n* WHAT...Minor flooding is forecast.\n\n* WHERE...Rio Grande  near Del Norte.\n\n* WHEN...Until Monday afternoon.\n\n* IMPACTS...At 5.5 feet, Minor Flood. The Del Norte Riverwalk Trail\nfloods.\n\n* ADDITIONAL DETAILS...\n- At 7:45 PM MDT Saturday the stage was 5.0 feet.\n- Bankfull stage is 5.0 feet.\n- Forecast...The river is expected to rise above flood stage\ntomorrow morning to a crest of 5.6 feet early tomorrow afternoon.\nIt will then fall below flood stage early Monday morning.\n- Flood stage is 5.5 feet.\n- Flood History...This crest compares to a previous crest of 5.6\nfeet on 06/10/1980.\n- http://www.weather.gov/safety/flood","ends":"2026-10-26T12:00:00-06:00","severity":"Severe","areaDesc":"Rio Grande, CO","id":"urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.7dd7bec4bfedb4e093a0b0a451793df607e5174e.001.1","url":"https://api.weather.gov/alerts/urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.7dd7bec4bfedb4e093a0b0a451793df607e5174e.001.1"},{"event":"Flood Warning","headline":"Flood Warning issued October 24 at 5:29PM MDT until October 25 at 9:45PM MDT by NWS Pueblo CO","description":"* WHAT...Flooding likely along the Rio Grande between Monte Vista and\nAlamosa.\n\n* WHERE...Southeastern Rio Grande County and West Central Alamosa\nCounty...\n\n* WHEN...Until 945 PM MDT Sunday.\n\n* IMPACTS...Flooding along the Rio Grande and low lying agricultural\nareas in Rio Grande and Alamosa counties is occurring.\n\n* ADDITIONAL DETAILS...\n- At 525 PM MDT, Emergency management reports flooding of low lying\nareas along and near the Rio Grande in Rio Grande county and in\nAlamosa county upstream of the city of Ala